Package: TALOS
Type: Package
Title: Detection of ITD / PTD / ALU Insertions from BAM Files
Version: 0.4.17
Date: 2026-11-12
Authors@R: c(
  person("TALOS", "Maintainer", email = "talos-maintainer@example.org",
         role = c("aut", "cre")))
Description: TALOS detects internal tandem duplications (ITDs), partial
    tandem duplications (PTDs) and ALU / SINE mobile-element insertions
    from short-read BAM files. ITDs are found by k-mer walking against the
    target-region reference; PTDs by an exon-graph search over split-read
    and discordant-pair evidence; ALU insertions by aligning soft-clipped
    read tails to a bundled ALU consensus. Reports are produced as TSV,
    VCF and self-contained HTML.
License: GPL-3
URL: https://github.com/lavauxt/TALOS
BugReports: https://github.com/lavauxt/TALOS/issues
